Ever felt that everyone is watching you when you're walking alone, wondering what to do with yourself or where to look? That's the crazy idea behind BusyProMax! Inspired by the little social anxiety many students experience on campus, we wanted to turn those awkward solo walks into something entertaining. Instead of endlessly scrolling or pretending to be occupied, BusyProMax gives you a collection of interactive activities, from video-call-style screens and Instagram-inspired messaging to ordering food, online shopping, texting, and checking villa security cameras. It's a playful take on the everyday things people do on their phones, bringing them together in one place. Because sometimes, you just want to walk across campus without feeling like the main character in everyone else's observation!
